WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.897 --> 00:00:03.199
You'll learn as you're going and get older,

00:00:03.499 --> 00:00:05.134
you make your own shortcut.

00:00:06.769 --> 00:00:08.371
You’ll always make it back home.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:11.608
Ready, Glyn?

00:00:11.608 --> 00:00:12.375
Oh, yeah.

00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:20.883
Glyn and I are off to pull out
crab pots from Olga Bay, where he has one

00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:22.418
And I have one. 

00:00:22.418 --> 00:00:25.355
And that increases our chances of getting crab.

00:00:29.258 --> 00:00:34.330
When we pull the crab pots it's a long way, about thirty-forty minutes skiff ride

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.906
Out here on the open water, the weather is not always in our favor because of the swell that washes right up. 

00:00:45.341 --> 00:00:48.811
The crab pots we’re
gonna pull are in a bay

00:00:49.245 --> 00:00:53.049
and it’s
a lot calmer and a lot easier to get.

00:00:53.549 --> 00:00:55.518
We got to get everything
before the winter hits.

00:00:55.518 --> 00:00:57.487
Otherwise,
it's pretty hard to get up there.

00:00:58.454 --> 00:00:59.389
You get some wicked

00:00:59.389 --> 00:01:01.924
winds with tide flowing in and out.

00:01:04.794 --> 00:01:07.664
Driving around out
here is like studying for a test.

00:01:08.831 --> 00:01:13.536
You got to memorize
where all the rocks are, any reefs.

00:01:13.536 --> 00:01:15.271
It's woo!

00:01:19.609 --> 00:01:22.145
Where is my buoy?

00:01:26.816 --> 00:01:29.252
It should be right here.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.423
You should see the buoy
no matter how many whitecaps there are.

00:01:33.423 --> 00:01:34.957
It’s a big orange buoy.

00:01:34.957 --> 00:01:37.427
It’s just like my Uncle Marvin’s gear
he has on.

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:46.335
Mine should be real close around here.

00:01:46.602 --> 00:01:49.405
It’s just that small cork
is very hard to see.

00:01:51.474 --> 00:01:55.445
If we find Glyn’s, I got a good bearing
of where my crab pot is.

00:01:55.445 --> 00:01:56.979
I don't see mine anywhere

00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:01.851
Is that the cork right there Glyn?

00:02:03.453 --> 00:02:04.587
Is that a cork?

00:02:04.587 --> 00:02:06.422
I think that’s your cork.

00:02:15.231 --> 00:02:18.134
We’re not finding Glyn’s crab pot,

00:02:18.134 --> 00:02:21.437
decreases the chance by half
because not all the pulls we do

00:02:21.437 --> 00:02:23.372
are successful king crab.

00:02:28.978 --> 00:02:32.115
Oh, you got that pipe out already,
okay. I got you.

00:02:44.393 --> 00:02:46.395
Our chances now are cut in half

00:02:46.395 --> 00:02:52.068
by one pot missing and hope we get something in this.

00:02:54.537 --> 00:02:55.571
There we go.

00:03:04.413 --> 00:03:05.581
Coming up, Glyn.

00:03:08.951 --> 00:03:10.052
You could stop it.

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:12.588
So, how’d we do?

00:03:12.588 --> 00:03:14.323
Whoa, look at that.

00:03:16.459 --> 00:03:17.827
Scored heavy.

00:03:19.028 --> 00:03:21.664
Like we scored, we are not going home

00:03:21.664 --> 00:03:22.765
empty handed.

00:03:31.274 --> 00:03:31.974
There you go.

00:03:33.309 --> 00:03:35.344
Lot of females.

00:03:35.912 --> 00:03:38.748
So, I think we got a couple keepers

00:03:38.748 --> 00:03:42.218
but there’s so much females, I’m
very happy to see that.

00:03:43.052 --> 00:03:43.886
Flip it over?

00:03:43.886 --> 00:03:44.153
Yeah.

00:03:44.153 --> 00:03:47.089
Oh, so happy to see females
because I know that at least there’s

00:03:47.089 --> 00:03:50.827
some there to reproduce
and that's a very good sign.

00:03:51.194 --> 00:03:54.297
This is a female Glyn.
See how the female round belly? Big

00:03:54.764 --> 00:03:55.231
Big belly.

00:03:55.231 --> 00:03:57.900
Oh is that the eggs right there?
You see them in there?

00:03:58.167 --> 00:03:59.068
Oh yeah. Yeah.

00:03:59.068 --> 00:03:59.936
There's a lot eggs.

00:03:59.936 --> 00:04:01.370
Females.

00:04:06.175 --> 00:04:07.376
It's the future.

00:04:07.376 --> 00:04:09.946
If there's anything that we want
is crab for the future.

00:04:10.479 --> 00:04:13.316
There’s a male to keep, how big he is.

00:04:13.316 --> 00:04:15.418
Keep her here? Yeah.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:18.955
All right.

00:04:19.288 --> 00:04:21.991
I lost my pot but, I’m bringing food home.

00:04:22.358 --> 00:04:23.860
Good stuff, Glyn.

00:04:26.696 --> 00:04:29.699
Well worth the trip,
even with half the crab pots.

00:04:30.867 --> 00:04:35.404
Found one crab pot,
what's missing is my big orange

00:04:35.404 --> 00:04:36.305
buoy.

